SUMMARY:South Orange Downtown  Food Stroll
DESCRIPTION:Big flavors. Local favorites. One unforgettable afternoon. The South Orange Downtown Food Stroll returns Sunday\, April 19 from 12PM – 4PM. Spend the day tasting your way through downtown with generous bites from a wide range of restaurants\, plus exclusive shopping deals and drink specials for wristband holders. \nPresale wristbands are available for purchase now for the best value and are expected to sell quickly. This is a self guided tasting event with limited quantities\, so purchasing in advance is strongly recommended. All proceeds go directly back to participating businesses. Visit this link to purchase and for more information: https://www.southorangedowntown.org/food-stroll-2026-presale \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
